Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:39.23,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(964,612)}Twenty-eight years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:43.62,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{Despite} Our blue skin and blood are \Ntruly{so} unique in this{e} vast universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:49.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(948,928)}Planet Garmillas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:54.24,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,We're proud of our blue blood. Because of that we've maintained our pure bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:02:00.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(960,1040)}Desler's Personal Residence at the former Garmillas Presidential Office
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:07.66,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Your Majesty Erich, is that true ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:11.86,def2,ERICH,0,0,0,,The end is near for our home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:16.68,def2,ERICH,0,0,0,,One hundred years at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:24.68,def2,ERICH,0,0,0,,Our blood is so pure that we can only live \Non another planet for a short period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:26.99,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:31.14,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,Uncle, we must find a new \Nplanet to migrate to immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.14,0:02:38.47,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,But, Mathius, it's not so easy to find a planet\N that can accept millions of people all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:41.36,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Sulzer's Sun is very unique…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:46.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{somosomo}Do we even need to take the \Nsecond class citizens with us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:47.84,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,What are you talking about ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:49.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Then, what do we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:54.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Encourage propagation with second class citizens so we can live on another planet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's unthinkable to abandon our noble skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:02.30,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Then we must rely on Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:03.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,If we do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:07.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We'll have to obey that planet's…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.07,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,Abelt…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:14.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Oh no…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What were the guards doing ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:25.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Those who have not taken the blood oath \Nshouldn't be involved in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.61,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Even the members of your\N family must obey the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:58.18,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,Uncle, please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:09.06,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,Abelt, pledge to maintain the secret right here…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:13.36,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,…and spend your entire life searching for a settlement in order to save Garmillas from going extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.80,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Brother Mathius…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:27.18,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:28.55,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,Promise me, okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:03.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(956,1032)}Twenty-two years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.36,def2,ADELSIA,0,0,0,,Mathius…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:22.40,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:25.17,def2,ADELSIA,0,0,0,,Mathius, please open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:30.46,def2,ADELSIA,0,0,0,,Mathius, don't leave me alone. \NWhy won't you wake up ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:33.12,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,He was a hero of the unification war…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:34.95,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Gone just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:38.54,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,His wife just got pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.03,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Desler family is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:45.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Some have natural talent, some don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:47.13,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,If Mathius was the light…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:51.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{otouto}…his brother Abelt would be the dark. \NHe's no match.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:06:01.35,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}They'll stop calling me the brother of the great Mathius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:06.08,def2,ADELSIA,0,0,0,,Mathius, where are you going ? \NYou can't go there…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:10.07,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Even so, you're unfair, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why are you taking Mother's soul with you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:16.92,def2,MATHIUS,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Promise me, okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:20.47,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You're shoving all the burden on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:35.08,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(966,1030)}Eighteen years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:44.33,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Iscandar…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Starsia…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:02.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What did you do to me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.36,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Did you read my memory ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:17.06,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Or perhaps it is I, who recalled my own memories\N after coming into contact with an omnipotent entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.51,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Führer Desler…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.12,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Who cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.62,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,What is your wish ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:38.04,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If the Goddess of Telezart is what the legend says, you should know without me telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.93,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,You can't communicate with them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.31,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Is that alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:52.19,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It's more frustrating than expected to face someone who sees through everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:54.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Desler, don't !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:10.18,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No contact with Kodai yet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:12.03,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,What about Nagakura ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:13.68,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,I can't locate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.47,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Could that fleet be…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.11,0:08:23.23,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Keyman, try cross-checking the\N Garmillas fleet ID signals with your database.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:24.37,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I'll check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:32.87,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Führer Desler, Teresa is not the kind of entity that can conveniently grant human wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:33.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:40.75,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Those who are summoned by Teresa are \Nsupposed to fulfill their duty for the rightful future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:48.50,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{mada}Mankind has had revelations of Teresa since before they learned to travel through the sea of stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:56.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{ayatsurare}Perhaps you can say,\N "under the manipulation of," for the sake of the rightful future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:03.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{jibun}That includes me. I couldn't\N lead my own life as I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:11.68,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{saa}Now, Teresa, display your grace\N to the ones chosen by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:16.28,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{hito}You're capable of doing things mankind can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:23.18,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,All living things are bound by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:26.65,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,However, it's a result of their own choices…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:37.20,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,…even if it appears to be wasteful or unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.30,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,I only show people the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:03.54,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,How you make decisions in your life\Nchanges that path, even the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:17.14,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Hanging between this universe and the afterlife, you can only watch how the world changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:21.34,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,God is powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:26.02,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,All ships are decommissioned according to the records.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:31.49,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,They've been wandering around space for 3 years after opposing the government's democratization.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:34.78,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,They're a diehard Desler faction after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:40.08,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,They don't seem to be aware of the allied channel between Garmillas and Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:41.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,You managed to hack in ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.68,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Their system's completely unaware of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:47.50,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,I can rewrite the friend-or-foe ID signal with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:52.00,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It'll take 30 seconds for them to restore\N their radar after noticing any abnormality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:53.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Can you go ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:55.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,No problem in my Czvarke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:59.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,This is the only way to contact Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:02.14,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We'll draw the attention of the enemy fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:08.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Desler, what did you expect of Teresa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:11.18,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Legend is just legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:14.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,But Emperor Zorder has a different vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:20.20,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,He's trying to neutralize{incapacitate} Teresa's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:28.96,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{sono}Now that I have Teresa under my control,\N I'm no longer his caged bird, but a negotiating rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:37.54,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{kodai}Ancient Archelias heritage gave the Gatlantians\N a military and scientific power they were unworthy of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:45.08,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{karera}It's possible to realize my dream\N by making use of their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:50.32,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{kami}I didn't expect anything from God in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:56.54,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{koko}I came here to obtain a bargaining\N chip for my negotiations with Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:12:03.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{terezart}You're trying to free the besieged Telezart, \Nwhich means, you're my enemy once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:10.82,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Do you know why the Emperor\N is trying to suppress Teresa's power ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:20.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If my assumption is correct, even if Gatlantis agrees to \Nnegotiate with you, it'll only last for a short period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:23.15,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The Emperor must want Teresa's power to{be}…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:30.33,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Führer, I'm terribly sorry to deliver some bad news, but the Yamato has made a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:32.38,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Moving to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:01.01,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander, are you safe ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:03.67,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nagakura, what the hell are you doing ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.94,0:13:05.28,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Just disobeying orders !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:10.58,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Full emergency descent !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:41.32,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Those guys are really tough !\NBe careful !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:41.88,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Got it !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:54.21,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}It's a lonely path. You must deceive\N everyone who becomes involved with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:58.12,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You're not supposed to take a role like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:02.18,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You'll eventually betray the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Czvarke's reached the sea surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.04,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,A large battleship is approaching from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:11.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Emergency ascent !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:32.37,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Fighting you guys is so unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.41,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Talan, do you read me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.04,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Get the ship back…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:47.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why don't we call an end to this, Führer Desler ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:55.20,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,How can we end things that haven't \Neven been started yet, Yamato lad ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:59.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'm Kodai Susumu, Chief Tactical Officer of the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:02.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{tadachi}I want you to withdraw your\N troops and leave Telezart at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:05.63,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:08.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I see. \NYou're that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:15.25,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You think you can convince someone\N who has already "died" once ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.14,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.48,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,So reckless…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:25.48,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Those puppets won't shoot me,\Nbut that's only while I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:28.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,So, why don't you pull the trigger ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:39.89,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kodai ?\N If you don't have the courage…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:47.63,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Now's our chance, Nagakura !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:48.28,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.47,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Nice, Mr. Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.51,0:16:24.50,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I want to ask you, Führer Desler. \NWhat brought you here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:29.00,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\pos(774,1052)}My name is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:38.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,My name is Ranhalt Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.36,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Desler…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:52.52,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Desler ! Desler ! Desler ! Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:54.83,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}How could this have happened ? {TEXT Fourteen years ago}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:54.83,Karaoke Translation op,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(972,918)}Fourteen years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:17:02.95,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I, Abelt Desler, wasn't important\N enough to keep Mother's soul in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.81,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:12.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Uncle united all of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:16.84,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'm entrusted to manage it,\N and keep the terrible fact secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:21.88,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Once you lose hope, you'll also lose your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:26.21,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If they find out that they have no future, Garmillas will…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:30.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is the most certain way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:38.14,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Ballerus Tower was built for that purpose.\N We can't turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:42.67,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}In order for Garmillas to survive, we need Iscandar's…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:47.23,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,1018)}Desler ! Desler ! Desler ! Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:51.40,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Desler ! Desler ! Desler ! Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:59.13,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,My dear citizens of the Garmillas Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:05.37,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,In order to achieve everlasting peace in the universe, \Nfurther expansion and integration of Iscandarism is necessary !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:12.45,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{sore}It is God's will, as well as the \Nnoble mission of every Garmillas citizen !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:20.92,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{kanou}Bring as many planets as possible under the control of Garmillas as quickly as possible !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:26.45,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{magellan}Turn your eyes beyond the \NMagellanic Cloud for further expansion !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:36.31,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Rapid expansion brought Garmillas \Nunprecedented wealth and power…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:41.61,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,…which birthed opposition to the Desler regime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:47.25,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You became the target of assassination many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:51.35,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Even by family members, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:53.98,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You're a dictator !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:57.52,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}If you had died instead of Mathius…!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:08.13,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I fabricated the execution of my\N brother's wife, and exiled her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:14.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That was the best I could do for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:24.11,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:29.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Desler family…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:34.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Mother died in poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:43.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Is it true that the planet Garmillas is about to die ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:57.05,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Working in the outer galaxy, I can feel that we, the pure Garmillan, can't survive too far away from the planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:07.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{dakara}So, we must find a planet with the same environment, \Nor artificially create one and move the entire population…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.47,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{han seiki}…within half a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:20.18,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,In order to bring such a tremendous plan into reality, you expanded your supremacy across space…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:23.71,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{reikoku}…while being condemned as a coldblooded dictator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:28.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Alteration of the environment using meteorite bombs…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:31.01,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,That's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:38.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Is it true that you're doing this to save Garmillas ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:41.19,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:45.34,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What difference does it make ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Right now, I have no strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:04.74,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Whether I pray to the powerless \NGod or negotiate with Gatlantis…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:09.24,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,…neither will give me an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:15.43,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:29.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Even so, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:40.56,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What Teresa's power is needed most for is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.94,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:52.59,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It's the mother planet Garmillas. \NThat's why you've been…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:57.98,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,W...wait, what are you talking about, Gamy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.65,0:22:02.76,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt{Ranhart}, the path is dreadful from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.02,0:22:11.30,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If you're going to go with me, let go of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.15,0:22:16.17,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If you become emotional,\Nyou'll make the same mistake I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:19.80,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Hey, don't listen to that bastard !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.52,0:22:22.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keyman !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:33.50,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:45.58,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 15
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:45.58,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(300,1038)}Teresa, Cry For Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:23:02.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1200,628)}Kodai {\3c&HFF0000&}Susumu:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NAihara Yoshikazu:\NSaijo Miki:\NKato Saburo:\NYamamoto Akira: \NSaito Hajime:\NNagakura Shiori:\NHijikata Ryu:\NKatsuragi Toko:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:23:02.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1224,148)}Ono Da{\3c&HFF0000&}isuke\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji \N Kokubun Masato\NMoriya Satomi\NHosoya Yoshimasa\NTanaka Rie \NTochi Hiroki\NAmagai Kazusa\NIshizuka Unsho\NKaida Yuko
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:11.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1174,732)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Abelt Desler:\NKlaus Keyman:\NGharder Talan:\NLoren Barrel:\NLutz Karzet:\NAdersia Desler:\NErich Desler:\NMathius Desler:\NTeresa:\NElsa Desler:\NAbelt Desler(child):\NGerd Aalen:\NGarstein Frinza: \NZolf Dorgen:\NBargin Dorales:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:11.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1200,132)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Yamadera Koichi\NKamioya Hiroshi \NNakamura Kotaro \NTerasoma Masaki \NOnozuka Takashi \NIkeda Masako \NInoue Kazuhiko \NKusao Takeshi \NKanda Sayaka \NNokubi Naoko \NOkada Emi \NKikumoto Taira \NHarada Akira \NYano Masaaki \N Fujinuma Kento
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sotto oyasuminasai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}A gentle goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Osanago no youna toiki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}You breathe like a little child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsumademo soba ni iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll be by your side forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Mabuta tojite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}So close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hidamari no takeru youna yasashisa de...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}As gentle as warm sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Tsusumi komu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}...I'll embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Shiawase umidasu chikara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}The power to bring happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Fuwari fuwari fuwa fuwa yume no naka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Drifting and floating, feeling like I'm having a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Omoi haseru yorisoinagara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Cuddling up and thinking of you from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsudemo waratte ite hoshii to negau
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My wish is for you to keep on smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ubu na egao tayasanu youni
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Never let your childlike smile disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itooshii hito yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My dearest{loved} one...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:21.38,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.20,0:25:23.35,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.35,0:25:25.09,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.09,0:25:26.68,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me, do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:28.48,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,Fate appears to be completely linked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.48,0:25:30.27,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I'll rescue him, no matter what !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.67,0:25:34.29,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What was I trying to destroy at that time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.93,0:25:34.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 16
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.93,0:25:34.93,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,684)} Farewell, Teresa! Cast Bouquets for{to} Two Deslers

